### 1. Register Attendee
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asha Lohana",
  "email": "asha@eventsphere.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "attendee",
  "interests": ["AI", "Web Development"]
}
### 2. Register Exhibitor
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TechCorp Expo",
  "email": "exhibitor@eventsphere.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "exhibitor",
  "companyName": "TechCorp Solutions",
  "companyCategory": "Artificial Intelligence"
}
### 3. Register Admin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Super Admin",
  "email": "admin@eventsphere.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "admin"
}
### 4. Login Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@eventsphere.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 5. Admin: View All Registered Users
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}



### A. Login as Admin (Get Authentication Token)
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@eventsphere.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### B. Create a New Expo (Admin Only)
# @name newExpo
POST http://localhost:5000/api/expos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Pakistan Tech & AI Expo 2026",
  "description": "Annual technology exhibition and developer summit",
  "theme": "AI & Web Development",
  "location": "Expo Center Karachi",
  "startDate": "2026-12-15",
  "endDate": "2026-12-17"
}


### C. Get All Expos with Search (Public Access)
# Search expos by title
GET http://localhost:5000/api/expos?search=Tech


### D. Create a New Booth for the Expo (Admin Only)
# @name newBooth
POST http://localhost:5000/api/booths
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

{
  "expo": "{{newExpo.response.body._id}}",
  "boothNumber": "A-101",
  "floorSection": "Hall 1 - AI Zone",
  "size": "12x12 ft"
}


### E. Create a New Session or Workshop (Admin Only)
# @name newSession
POST http://localhost:5000/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

{
  "expo": "{{newExpo.response.body._id}}",
  "title": "Building Full-Stack AI Apps with MERN",
  "description": "Hands-on workshop on integrating AI into React & Node",
  "speakerName": "Dr. Kamran Ahmed",
  "topic": "AI",
  "hallLocation": "Main Auditorium",
  "date": "2026-12-15",
  "startTime": "11:00 AM",
  "endTime": "12:30 PM"
}

### ==========================================
### ATTENDEE, SEARCH & FEEDBACK API TESTS
### ==========================================


### F. Login as Attendee (Get Authentication Token)
# @name attendeeLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "asha@eventsphere.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### G. Register for an Expo (Attendee Only)
# Link the attendee's digital pass with the selected expo
POST http://localhost:5000/api/attendee/register-expo/{{newExpo.response.body._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{attendeeLogin.response.body.token}}


### H. Add a Session to Personal Schedule (Attendee Only)
# Bookmark the selected session
POST http://localhost:5000/api/attendee/bookmark-session/{{newSession.response.body._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{attendeeLogin.response.body.token}}


### I. View Personal Schedule and Recommended Sessions
# Get bookmarked sessions and personalized recommendations
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendee/my-schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{attendeeLogin.response.body.token}}


### J. Submit Feedback for an Expo (Attendee Only)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{attendeeLogin.response.body.token}}

{
  "expo": "{{newExpo.response.body._id}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Amazing AI workshops and smooth digital pass entry!"
}


### K. View All Submitted Feedback (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

